    "description": "Devyani International Holdings Services is actively seeking a talented and motivated Reservation Manager to join our dynamic team in Patna. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Devyani International Holdings Services:\nDevyani International Holdings Services is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n• Coordinate housekeeping and maintenance for room readiness\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Revenue Management\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Yield Management\n• Proficiency in Food Safety\n• Proficiency in OTA Management\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in MICE\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Learning & development budget\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Flexible working hours\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Patna, Bihar, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Devyani International Holdings Services!",
